[{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_07030000_00_0011","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_07030000_00_0010","text":"日花\n我买了甜甜圈回来，要吃吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_07030000_00_0020","text":"……您是开玩笑的吧？\n那可是最容易胖的东西啊——"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_07030000_00_0030","text":"咦，不要吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_07030000_00_0040","text":"…………我会吃的"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_07030000_00_0005","text":"要是和果子之类的\n就好了吗……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_07030000_00_0006","text":"不用勉强\n也没关系的"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_07030000_00_0007","text":"吃了之后\n动一动不就好了吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_07030000_01_0011","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_07030000_01_0010","text":"又不是卡路里的问题……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_07030000_01_0020","text":"那我发链接给您，\n下次请买好一点的和果子——"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_07030000_02_0011","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_07030000_02_0010","text":"……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_07030000_02_0020","text":"我都说了会吃的……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_07030000_03_0011","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_07030000_03_0010","text":"……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s03_07030000_03_0020","text":"到底是想让我吃还是想让我运动，\n是哪个啊……！？"}]
